        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="drivernote" value="Databases dominate (88% of 1×); its 20× figure depends on the ledger posting-rate measurement. Networking and Monitoring are the super-linear drivers (NAT data processing, log/trace ingestion) — bent down with VPC endpoints, lower X-Ray sampling, Savings Plans and Aurora reserved capacity." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#5A6C86;" parent="1" vertex="1">
